 the night and hires by the day; a fair price for good animals."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Stable district","family":"Stable district","title":"the stable master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Council","rank":3,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"notable","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_beast_trainers","name":"Walpurga Ormsson","gender":"female","role":"the beast master","title":"the beast master","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"vengeful","modifier":"ambitious","tell":"repeats the last word of a sentence spoken to them before responding","speech":"Never interrupts, waits out even the longest speaker, then answers the first point only"},"physical":{"age":"late forties","build":"compact and powerful","feature":"a cloak clasped with an unusual brooch","clothes":"dress entirely without signal (deliberately so)"},"goal":{"short":"Fix a problem Geira Snorrason has left standing in Merchant Guilds, and make sure everyone knows who fixed it.","long":"Make sure no one wrongs them twice.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"climb","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_stone_quarry"}},"long":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"grudge","key":"indulge_trait","target":null}}},"secret":{"what":"A dangerous animal got loose last year and killed a child, and the beast master said it was a wild one","stakes":"Someone saw the collar marks on the beast before it was killed, and has not forgotten"},"plotHooks":["They overheard two people they know settle a bribe, and do not know whom to tell."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Practical and direct. Talks about animals the way others talk about tools.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Sells and trains to order; the price depends on the animal and the job."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Beast trainers","family":"Beast trainers","title":"the beast master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":3,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"notable","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_docks_port_facilities","name":"Eirik Asgautsson","gender":"male","role":"the wharfinger","title":"the wharfinger","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"humble","flaw":null,"modifier":"hedonistic","tell":"never makes direct eye contact with inferiors","speech":"Speaks in short, clipped sentences: every word intentional"},"physical":{"age":"mid-forties","build":"imposingly tall","feature":"ink-work visible at the collar and cuffs","clothes":"work clothes patched by someone who loved them"},"goal":{"short":"Buy timber at the market in bulk this season, while the price is still fair.","long":"Reach the head of Merchant Council and run it the way Freya Ljotsson never would.","intent":{"short":{"family":"SUPPLY","kind":"dependency","key":"secure_supply","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Docks/port facilities"}},"long":{"family":"RANK","kind":"climb","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_merchant_guilds_3_8"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has let the wharf's timbers rot and pocketed the money meant for repairs","stakes":"When a pier gives way under a load, the wharfinger will be the first one asked why"},"plotHooks":["Two neighbours have each asked them to stand witness in the same dispute, on opposite sides."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Weathered, loud and quick with figures. Has a berth and a fee for every ship.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Names the fee for a berth and the time it is free; pays attention to which ships pay on time."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Docks/port facilities","family":"Docks/port facilities","title":"the wharfinger","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Council","rank":2,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"key","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_fighting_pits","name":"Záleif Leidolfsson","gender":"male","role":"the pit boss","title":"the pit boss","category":"criminal","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"stubborn","modifier":"secretive","tell":"keeps a coin or token that they flip when making decisions","speech":"Pauses mid-sentence to choose words with visible care"},"physical":{"age":"early twenties","build":"heavyset and solid","feature":"sun-darkened skin that suggests years outdoors","clothes":"fine clothes worn ironically over rougher garments"},"goal":{"short":"Have those who govern confirm, in writing, who may give orders at the fighting pits.","long":"Make peace between Thieves' Guild and Merchant Council on terms Thieves' Guild can live with.","intent":{"short":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"charter","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Fighting pits"}},"long":{"family":"POWER","kind":"tense","key":"expand_influence","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Merchant Council"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Fixes fights and takes bets on the outcome they have already chosen","stakes":"The bettors who lost their money would want blood, and some of them have friends who could take it"},"plotHooks":["A valuable item came through their network recently. Three different parties have asked about it quietly."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Loud and friendly with a purse in every hand. Talks in odds.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Takes bets, sells places by the pit and will match a fighter for a fee."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Fighting pits","family":"Fighting pits","title":"the pit boss","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Thieves' Guild","rank":2,"share":0.5,"veiled":true},{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":null,"share":0.5,"veiled":false}],"importance":"key","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_apothecary_established","name":"Ulfhéðinn Bjornsson","gender":"male","role":"the apothecary","title":"the apothecary","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"methodical","flaw":"deceitful","modifier":"melancholic","tell":"speaks of themselves in the third person when angry","speech":"Deflects personal questions with philosophical tangents"},"physical":{"age":"early sixties","build":"stocky and broad-shouldered","feature":"surprisingly soft hands","clothes":"travel-worn but well-maintained gear"},"goal":{"short":"Show the rest of Craft Guilds that Inga Bodvarsson can be wrong, without ever saying so aloud.","long":"Know something about everyone who matters here.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"climb","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_sawmill_commercial"}},"long":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"forbidden_patron","key":"indulge_trait","target":null}}},"secret":{"what":"Sells a few drops of something stronger to anyone who asks quietly and pays in silver","stakes":"One customer died last season of what was sold; if that came out, so would the list of who else buys it"},"plotHooks":["A document they were asked to witness contained a clause they noticed at the time and said nothing about."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Smells of dried herbs and vinegar. Asks after your health as if they mean it.","disposition":"welcoming","behaviour":"Listens to every symptom, names a remedy and a price, and remembers what you bought."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Apothecary (established)","family":"Apothecary district","title":"the apothecary","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":3,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"allegiance":{"power":"Thieves' Guild","house":"Street gang","vector":"forbidden_patron","via":"retainer","handler":"npc_veiled_e01881c4d24ae7e3","share":0.15,"veiled":true,"covert":true},"importance":"notable","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_sawmill_commercial","name":"Inga Bodvarsson","gender":"female","role":"the sawyer","title":"the sawyer","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"cruel","modifier":"proud","tell":"traces patterns on flat surfaces absentmindedly","speech":"Uses softening phrases that make every statement sound like a question"},"physical":{"age":"late sixties","build":"tall with a slight stoop","feature":"laugh lines that run deep","clothes":"whatever was available (they don't care about dress)"},"goal":{"short":"Take one thing from a person they resent.","long":"Lead Craft Guilds one day, with Rorik Mordsson's blessing or without it.","intent":{"short":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"grudge","key":"indulge_trait","target":null},"long":{"family":"RANK","kind":"climb","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_craft_guilds_5_15"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Sells green planks as seasoned and the buildings made from them warp within a year","stakes":"The builders who used the wood would want their losses back, and their customers would want them first"},"plotHooks":["They found something hidden in a place it shouldn't be. They put it back. They haven't told anyone."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Sawdust everywhere, a loud voice and hands missing the tip of one finger.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Cuts to measure and sells by the length; wants the order written and half paid."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Sawmill (commercial)","family":"Sawmill (commercial)","title":"the sawyer","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":2,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"key","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_town_watch","name":"Hildr Bodvarsson","gender":"female","role":"the watch captain","title":"the watch captain","category":"military","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":null,"modifier":"detached","tell":"hums under their breath when concentrating","speech":"Drops to a near-whisper when saying something important"},"physical":{"age":"early thirties","build":"imposingly tall","feature":"a slight accent","clothes":"a field coat carrying the insignia of a disbanded company"},"goal":{"short":"Catch Jarl Asgautsson with something from the street gang on th