luence","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}},"long":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"takeover","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Fish market"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Holds back salt in a good year to keep the price high, and sells it dear when the shortage comes","stakes":"The families who could not salt their winter stores would want the salt master to answer for it"},"plotHooks":["They have quietly stopped paying a supplier who cannot afford to take them to law."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Watches the pans and the carts closely, and the people near them more closely.","disposition":"cautious","behaviour":"Talks about the trade; asks why you want so much salt if you buy a lot."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Salt works","family":"Salt works","title":"the salt master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Council","rank":null,"share":0.5,"veiled":false},{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":null,"share":0.5,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_hunter_s_lodge","name":"Halfdan Ulfsson","gender":"male","role":"the master of the hunt","title":"the master of the hunt","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"vengeful","modifier":"iconoclast","tell":"flinches slightly at raised voices even when calm","speech":"Prefaces bad news with elaborate courtesy, good news with none"},"physical":{"age":"late sixties","build":"barrel-chested","feature":"a cloak clasped with an unusual brooch","clothes":"whatever was available (they don't care about dress)"},"goal":{"short":"Bring Rorik Mordsson together with someone who can help them.","long":"Build up stores large enough that the work at the hunter's lodge never stops for lack of supply again.","intent":{"short":{"family":"TIES","kind":"ally","key":"protect_ally","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_craft_guilds_5_15"}},"long":{"family":"SUPPLY","kind":"impaired","key":"secure_supply","target":{"kind":"chain","id":"hunting"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been hunting on land that belongs to someone else and selling the game in the market","stakes":"The landowner has found the snares and is asking who set them"},"plotHooks":["They've been offered money to not ask questions about something they hadn't even started asking about."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Watchful of strangers in the woods. Studies your boots and your gear.","disposition":"cautious","behaviour":"Asks what you are hunting and where before saying anything."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Hunter's lodge","family":"Hunter's lodge","title":"the master of the hunt","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_inn_multiple","name":"Drifa Andersson","gender":"female","role":"the innkeeper","title":"the innkeeper","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"good-humoured","flaw":null,"modifier":"fatalistic","tell":"keeps meticulous written records of every meeting","speech":"Defaults to numbers and specifics: 'three days', never 'some days'"},"physical":{"age":"late twenties","build":"slight: smaller than expected for the role","feature":"a prosthetic hand, finely crafted","clothes":"work clothes patched by someone who loved them"},"goal":{"short":"Have those who govern confirm, in writing, who may give orders at the inn.","long":"Leave Craft Guilds holding nothing that Merchant Guilds could not take away.","intent":{"short":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"charter","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Inn (multiple)"}},"long":{"family":"POWER","kind":"competitive","key":"expand_influence","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Reads the letters guests leave in their rooms, and sells what is in them to whoever asks the right way","stakes":"No traveller would sleep under that roof again, and some of the people named i