 the day; a fair price for good animals."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Stable district","family":"Stable district","title":"the stable master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Council","rank":3,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"notable","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_beast_trainers","name":"Walpurga Ormsson","gender":"female","role":"the beast master","title":"the beast master","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"vengeful","modifier":"ambitious","tell":"repeats the last word of a sentence spoken to them before responding","speech":"Never interrupts, waits out even the longest speaker, then answers the first point only"},"physical":{"age":"late forties","build":"compact and powerful","feature":"a cloak clasped with an unusual brooch","clothes":"dress entirely without signal (deliberately so)"},"goal":{"short":"Fix a problem Geira Snorrason has left standing in Merchant Guilds, and make sure everyone knows who fixed it.","long":"Make sure no one wrongs them twice.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"climb","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_stone_quarry"}},"long":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"grudge","key":"indulge_trait","target":null}}},"secret":{"what":"A dangerous animal got loose last year and killed a child, and the beast master said it was a wild one","stakes":"Someone saw the collar marks on the beast before it was killed, and has not forgotten"},"plotHooks":["They overheard two people they know settle a bribe, and do not know whom to tell."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Practical and direct. Talks about animals the way others talk about tools.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Sells and trains to order; the price depends on the animal and the job."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Beast trainers","family":"Beast trainers","title":"the beast master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":3,"shar