al","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"stubborn","modifier":"secretive","tell":"keeps a coin or token that they flip when making decisions","speech":"Pauses mid-sentence to choose words with visible care"},"physical":{"age":"early twenties","build":"heavyset and solid","feature":"sun-darkened skin that suggests years outdoors","clothes":"fine clothes worn ironically over rougher garments"},"goal":{"short":"Have those who govern confirm, in writing, who may give orders at the fighting pits.","long":"Make peace between Thieves' Guild and Merchant Council on terms Thieves' Guild can live with.","intent":{"short":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"charter","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Fighting pits"}},"long":{"family":"POWER","kind":"tense","key":"expand_influence","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Merchant Council"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Fixes fights and takes bets on the outcome they have already chosen","stakes":"The bettors who lost their money would want blood, and some of them have friends who could take it"},"plotHooks":["A valuable item came through their network recently. Three different parties have asked about it quietly."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Loud and friendly with a purse in every hand. Talks in odds.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Takes bets, sells places by the pit and will match a fighter for a fee."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Fighting pits","family":"Fighting pits","title":"the pit boss","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Thieves' Guild","rank":2,"share":0.5,"veiled":true},{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":null,"share":0.5,"veiled":false}],"importance":"key","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_apothecary_established","name":"Ulfhéðinn Bjornsson","gender":"male","role":"the apothecary","title":"the apothecary","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"methodical","flaw":"deceitful","modifier":"melancholic","tell":"speaks of themselves in the third person when angry","speech":"Deflects personal questions with philosophical tangents"},"physical":{"age":"early sixties","build":"stocky and broad-shouldered","feature":"surprisingly soft hands","clothes":"travel-worn but well-maintained gear"},"goal":{"short":"Show the rest of Craft Guilds that Inga Bodvarsson can be wrong, without ever saying so aloud.","long":"Know something about everyone who matters here.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"climb","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_sawmill_commercial"}},"long":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"forbidden_patron","key":"indulge_trait","target":null}}},"secret":{"what":"Sells a few drops of something stronger to anyone who asks quietly and pays in silver","stakes":"One customer died last season of what was sold; if that came out, so would the list of who else buys it"},"plotHooks":["A document they were asked to witness contained a clause they noticed at the time and said nothing about."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Smells of dried herbs and vinegar. Asks after your health as if they mean it.","disposition":"welcoming","behaviour":"Listens to every symptom, names a remedy and a price, and remembers what you bought."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Apothecary (established)","family":"Apothecary district","title":"the apothecary","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":3,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"allegiance":{"power":"Thieves' Guild","house":"Street gang","vector":"forbidden_patron","via":"retainer","handler":"npc_veiled_e01881c4d24ae7e3","share":0.15,"veiled":true,"covert":true},"importance":"notable","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_sawmill_commercial","name":"Inga Bodvarsson","gender":"female","role":"the sawyer","title":"the sawyer","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"cruel","modifier":"proud","tell":"traces patterns on flat surfaces absentmindedly","speech":"Uses softening phrases that make every statement sound like a question"},"physical":{"age":"late sixties","build":"tall with a slight stoop","feature":"laugh lines that run deep","clothes":"whatever was available (they don't care about dress)"},"goal":{"short":"Take one thing from a person they resent.","long":"Lead Craft Guilds one day, with Rorik Mordsson's blessing or without it.","intent":{"short":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"grudge","key":"indulge_trait","target":null},"long":{"family":"RANK","kind":"climb","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_craft_guilds_5_15"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Sells green planks as seasoned and the buildings made from them warp within a year","stakes":"The builders who used the wood would want their losses back, and their customers would want them first"},"plotHooks":["They found something hidden in a place it shouldn't be. They put it back. They haven't told anyone."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Sawdust everywhere, a loud voice and hands missing the tip of one finger.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Cuts to measure and sells by the length; wants the order written and half paid."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Sawmill (commercial)","family":"Sawmill (commercial)","title":"the sawyer","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":2,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"key","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_town_watch","name":"Hildr Bodvarsson","gender":"female","role":"the watch captain","title":"the watch captain","category":"military","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":null,"modifier":"detached","tell":"hums under their breath when concentrating","speech":"Drops to a near-whisper when saying something important"},"physical":{"age":"early thirties","build":"imposingly tall","feature":"a slight accent","clothes":"a field coat carrying the insignia of a disbanded company"},"goal":{"short":"Catch Jarl Asgautsson with something from the street gang on them, in front of witnesses.","long":"Secure rights for the town watch that will outlast whoever governs now.","intent":{"short":{"family":"ALLEGIANCE","kind":"warrant","key":"pursue_warrant","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_veiled_e01881c4d24ae7e3"}},"long":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"charter","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Town watch"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Is under a compulsion placed by someone who is now dead, and it's getting harder to resist","stakes":"The compulsion will eventually force an action that exposes everything"},"plotHooks":["The ambush that killed two of their best people wasn't random. Someone knew the patrol route."],"influence":"high","power":9,"presentation":{"impression":"Professionally cordial: the manner of someone who deals with strangers all day and has a system for it.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Trades in coin, not talk; asks nothing about you and says nothing of their own business."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Town watch","family":"Citizen militia","title":"the watch captain","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Council","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_salt_works","name":"Vidar Andersson","gender":"male","role":"the salt master","title":"the salt master","category":"economy","personality":{"dominant":"astute","flaw":null,"modifier":"proud","tell":"keeps their hands clasped behind their back when displeased","speech":"Answers questions with inventories: 'Three reasons. First.'"},"physical":{"age":"early fifties","build":"average height, unremarkable frame","feature":"ink-stained fingers","clothes":"well-cut but understated trading clothes"},"goal":{"short":"Lure one capable person away from Craft Guilds to work for Merchant Guilds.","long":"Own every step of the work that the salt works and the fish market now split between them.","intent":{"short":{"family":"POWER","kind":"competitive","key":"expand_influence","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}},"long":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"takeover","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Fish market"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Holds back salt in a good year to keep the price high, and sells it dear when the shortage comes","stakes":"The families who could not salt their winter stores would want the salt master to answer for it"},"plotHooks":["They have quietly stopped paying a supplier who cannot afford to take them to law."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Watches the pans and the carts closely, and the people near them more closely.","disposition":"cautious","behaviour":"Talks about the trade; asks why you want so much salt if you buy a lot."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Salt works","family":"Salt works","title":"the salt master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Council","rank":null,"share":0.5,"veiled":false},{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":null,"share":0.5,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_hunter_s_lodge","name":"Halfdan Ulfsson","gender":"male","role":"the master of the hunt","title":"the master of the hunt","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"vengeful","modifier":"iconoclast","tell":"flinches slightly at raised voices even when calm","speech":"Prefaces bad news with elaborate courtesy, good news with none"},"physical":{"age":"late sixties","build":"barrel-chested","feature":"a cloak clasped with an unusual brooch","clothes":"whatever was available (they don't care about dress)"},"goal":{"short":"Bring Rorik Mordsson together with someone who can help them.","long":"Build up stores large enough that the work at the hunter's lodge never stops for lack of supply again.","intent":{"short":{"family":"TIES","kind":"ally","key":"protect_ally","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_craft_guilds_5_15"}},"long":{"family":"SUPPLY","kind":"impaired","key":"secure_supply","target":{"kind":"chain","id":"hunting"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been hunting on land that belongs to someone else and selling the game in the market","stakes":"The landowner has found the snares and is asking who set them"},"plotHooks":["They've been offered money to not ask questions about something they hadn't even started asking about."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Watchful of strangers in the woods. Studies your boots and your gear.","disposition":"cautious","behaviour":"Asks what you are hunting and where before saying anything."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Hunter's lodge","family":"Hunter's lodge","title":"the master of the hunt","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_inn_multiple","name":"Drifa Andersson","gender":"female","role":"the innkeeper","title":"the innkeeper","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"good-humoured","flaw":null,"modifier":"fatalistic","tell":"keeps meticulous written records of every meeting","speech":"Defaults to numbers and specifics: 'three days', never 'some days'"},"physical":{"age":"late twenties","build":"slight: smaller than expected for the role","feature":"a prosthetic hand, finely crafted","clothes":"work clothes patched by someone who loved them"},"goal":{"short":"Have those who govern confirm, in writing, who may give orders at the inn.","long":"Leave Craft Guilds holding nothing that Merchant Guilds could not take away.","intent":{"short":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"charter","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Inn (multiple)"}},"long":{"family":"POWER","kind":"competitive","key":"expand_influence","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Reads the letters guests leave in their rooms, and sells what is in them to whoever asks the right way","stakes":"No traveller would sleep under that roof again, and some of the people named in those letters would come looking"},"plotHooks":["A regular customer has stopped coming. The reason they've been given doesn't make sense."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Busy, and good at being busy. Counts the room with one look: who has paid, who has not.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Friendly while the coin lasts; asks for payment up front from anyone they have not seen before."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Inn (multiple)","family":"Inns and taverns (district)","title":"the innkeeper","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_taverns_5_20","name":"Vagn Gormsson","gender":"male","role":"the tavern keeper","title":"the tavern keeper","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"stalwart","flaw":"mendacious","modifier":"stoic","tell":"laughs loudly at their own jokes, silently at others'","speech":"Tells anecdotes that never quite reach the point"},"physical":{"age":"early sixties","build":"compact and powerful","feature":"a network of small scars on their knuckles","clothes":"work clothes patched by someone who loved them"},"goal":{"short":"Keep every meeting with Záleif Leidolfsson secret, even from their closest friends.","long":"Keep Thorvald Styrkarsson in debt for as long as it is useful.","intent":{"short":{"family":"ALLEGIANCE","kind":"serve_forbidden_patron","key":"serve_patron","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Thieves' Guild"}},"long":{"family":"TIES","kind":"creditor","key":"collect_debt","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_parish_churches_2_5"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been feeding strategic intelligence to outsiders who pay for it","stakes":"Treason charges; execution or exile in most jurisdictions"},"plotHooks":["A letter addressed to them was opened before it arrived, and the sender says it carried money."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Ordinary in a way that is itself a kind of presence.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Agrees quickly, and the terms are never quite what you remember agreeing to."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Taverns (5-20)","family":"Alehouse","title":"the tavern keeper","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Council","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"allegiance":{"power":"Thieves' Guild","house":"Street gang","vector":"forbidden_patron","via":"retainer","handler":"npc_fighting_pits","share":0.15,"veiled":true,"covert":true},"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_coaching_inn","name":"Auðr Snorrason","gender":"female","role":"the coaching-inn keeper","title":"the coaching-inn keeper","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":null,"modifier":"restless","tell":"maintains an unnervingly fixed smile during conflict","speech":"Ends disagreements by restating the other position, slightly wrong"},"physical":{"age":"late sixties","build":"willowy","feature":"ink-stained fingers","clothes":"a good coat inherited from a larger relative"},"goal":{"short":"Grow the work at the coaching inn by one more pair of hands, then another.","long":"See more of the world than this place.","intent":{"short":{"family":"SUPPLY","kind":"expansion","key":"expand_trade_house","target":{"kind":"chain","id":"crossroads_trade"}},"long":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"impulse","key":"indulge_trait","target":null}}},"secret":{"what":"Changes tired horses for fresh ones and sells the good ones on, giving travellers the worst of the stable","stakes":"Travellers whose coaches broke down have started comparing notes"},"plotHooks":["Three different people have asked them the same unusual question. None of them knew each other."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Efficient and loud. Calls out departures and prices in the same breath.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Sells places on the coach and beds by the night; asks for payment first."},"institution":{"kind":"h