ical","tell":"pauses for exactly three seconds before answering any question","speech":"Speaks in analogies and metaphors, even when clarity would serve better"},"physical":{"age":"late thirties","build":"barrel-chested","feature":"laugh lines that run deep","clothes":"weathered gear maintained past the point of economy"},"goal":{"short":"Find the weak spot in what Grettir Hrafnsson is doing, and press on it.","long":"Build up enough savings at the mills to ride out two bad years.","intent":{"short":{"family":"TIES","kind":"rival_enemy","key":"settle_rivalry","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_tailor_s_guild"}},"long":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"solvency","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Mills (2-5)"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been keeping back a handful from every sack brought to the mill for grinding, and selling the extra flour on the side","stakes":"The farmers would take their grain elsewhere, and some of them would want the old losses paid back"},"plotHooks":["Someone keeps paying off their small debts around the place before they can, and has left no name."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Watches the sacks more than the people carrying them. Weighs everything twice.","disposition":"cautious","behaviour":"Answers what is asked and no more; turns the talk back to the weight of the grain."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Mills (2-5)","family":"Mills (2-5)","title":"the miller","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Council","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_weavers_textile_workers","name":"Kjara Eindriðason","gender":"female","role":"the master weaver","title":"the master weaver","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"paranoid","modifier":"melancholic","tell":"refuses to sit with their back to a door","speech":"Uses understatement and dry humour as a defence mechanism"},"physical":{"age":"early forties","build"