continued to live side by side, their history unresolved","severity":"major","lastingEffects":["Collaborator and resistance families still keep apart"],"plotHooks":["Resistance fighters kept records that would expose people still in power","Families who lived through it tell it this way: a former occupier officer has returned under a false identity"],"templateType":"occupation_legacy","anchored":true},{"yearsAgo":44,"type":"political","name":"The Tyranny","description":"One figure took power by economic pressure and held it unchecked for a season, and the memory still governs who the town will trust with authority","severity":"catastrophic","lastingEffects":[],"plotHooks":["The records of that time say: someone is deliberately rehabilitating the tyrant’s reputation, and profiting from it","An old story from that time: a fortune the regime confiscated was never returned, and the rightful heirs have surfaced"],"templateType":"tyranny"},{"yearsAgo":25,"type":"economic","name":"The Economic Divide","description":"A widening gulf between the well-off and the working poor breeds lasting resentment","severity":"major","lastingEffects":["The merchant quarter and the labourers' quarter remain walled apart"],"plotHooks":["A merchant is funding both the reform movement and the suppression of it"],"templateType":"economic_disparity","anchored":true}],"currentTensions":[{"type":"magical_controversy","description":"Debate over the role and regulation of magic divides the community","factions":["Pro-magic","Anti-magic","Regulation advocates"],"lastingEffects":["Spellcasting now requires a licence from the local authority","The site of the disputed working remains cordoned and warded"],"plotHooks":["A recent magical accident was covered up and the victims silenced","An anti-magic agitator is secretly using magic themselves","Something was sealed away using magic years ago and the seal is weakening"],"severity":["minor","major"]}],"historicalCharacter":"This place is older than the 