 formal wear that has clearly never seen weather"},"goal":{"short":"Fix a problem Genji Wei has left standing in Guild Council, and make sure everyone knows who fixed it.","long":"Own a share in the supply of grain, so the work at the town granary can never be held to ransom.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"climb","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_merchant_warehouses"}},"long":{"family":"SUPPLY","kind":"dependency","key":"secure_supply","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Town granary"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Knows something about Tae Huang that Tae Huang believes no one else knows, and has been deciding for months whether to use it","stakes":"Tae Huang would move against them immediately if they suspected"},"plotHooks":["They know who committed a crime the guard is currently investigating. They're not telling the guard."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Speaks in sacks and measures. Weighs you as they would weigh a load.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Sells from the stores at the agreed price; wants it written down and paid."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Town granary","family":"Town granary","title":"the granary reeve","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Guild Council","rank":2,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"key","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_courthouse","name":"Ai Inoue","gender":"female","role":"the magistrate","title":"the magistrate","category":"government","personality":{"dominant":"temperate","flaw":"corrupt","modifier":"calculating","tell":"deflects personal questions with a counter-question","speech":"Speaks in analogies and metaphors, even when clarity would serve better"},"physical":{"age":"mid-twenties","build":"tall with a slight stoop","feature":"a habit of standing very still","clothes":"immaculate formal wear that has clearly never seen weather"},"goal":{"short":"Win two more people in Guild Council over to their side before Xin Hayashi notices.","l