ting, and the training is cruel","stakes":"The animals' scars would tell the story, and the buyers would turn on the trainer to save themselves"},"plotHooks":["A child they took in as a favour has family who want the child back, and want paying for the years."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Practical and direct. Talks about animals the way others talk about tools.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Sells and trains to order; the price depends on the animal and the job."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Beast trainers","family":"Beast trainers","title":"the beast master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":3,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"notable","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_mills_2_5","name":"Kazuko Xie","gender":"female","role":"the miller","title":"the miller","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"diligent","flaw":null,"modifier":"reserved","tell":"speaks of themselves in the third person when angry","speech":"Verbose and elaborate; takes three sentences where one would do"},"physical":{"age":"late thirties","build":"lean and wiry","feature":"laugh lines that run deep","clothes":"work clothes patched by someone who loved them"},"goal":{"short":"Keep the mills working through the season even if the supply of grain and water power should fail.","long":"Build up enough savings at the mills to ride out two bad years.","intent":{"short":{"family":"SUPPLY","kind":"dependency","key":"secure_supply","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Mills (2-5)"}},"long":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"solvency","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Mills (2-5)"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has written for years to someone in a far city they have never met, and is in love with the handwriting","stakes":"The letters have stopped"},"plotHooks":["They saw an accident that was no accident, and the person responsible knows they saw it."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Flour in the creases of the knuckles and on both sleeves. They talk over the noise of the stones without raising their voice.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Will grind for anyone who pays the toll; wants to know whose grain it is before naming the price."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Mills (2-5)","family":"Mills (2-5)","title":"the miller","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Landed Gentry","rank":3,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"notable","structuralRank":"inner_circle"},{"id":"npc_tanners","name":"Nianzu Yamamoto","gender":"male","role":"the tanner","title":"the tanner","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"clever","flaw":"volatile","modifier":"mercurial","tell":"refuses to sit with their back to a door","speech":"Talks to everyone in the room except the person the answer is for"},"physical":{"age":"late forties","build":"barrel-chested","feature":"ink-stained fingers","clothes":"second-hand fine clothes that don't quite fit"},"goal":{"short":"Be the one Dan Tanaka sends whenever something must be done for Craft Guilds this season.","long":"Never be tied to one thing for long.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"climb","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_blacksmiths_3_10"}},"long":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"impulse","key":"indulge_trait","target":null}}},"secret":{"what":"Dumps the pits' waste in the stream after dark, and the water below has turned","stakes":"The families downstream would want the yard closed, and the farmers would want their dead animals paid for"},"plotHooks":["They agreed to hold a parcel for a traveller, and two different people have since come to collect it."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Smells of the pits and keeps visitors at a distance.","disposition":"dismissive","behaviour":"Names the price for a hide and wants you gone."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Tanners","family":"Tanners","title":"the tanner","veiled":f