 full and on time this season.","long":"Be remembered as the one who ended the quarrel between Craft Guilds and Guild Council over prices set on everyday goods.","intent":{"short":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"solvency","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Carriers' guild"}},"long":{"family":"POWER","kind":"conflict","key":"settle_rivalry","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Guild Council"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been keeping back part of the carriers' wages as fees they never agreed to","stakes":"The carriers are close to walking out, and they know where everything is"},"plotHooks":["A rival has hired away their two best hands in one week, on wages the rival cannot afford for long."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Loud, practical and quick. Has a carrier and a price for every load.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Hires carriers by the day and the load; heavy loads cost more."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Carriers' guild","family":"Carriers' hiring hall","title":"the carriers' master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_carpenters_5_15","name":"Yuki Liang","gender":"male","role":"the master carpenter","title":"the master carpenter","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":null,"modifier":"obsessive","tell":"always arrives fifteen minutes early, and comments when others do not","speech":"Says 'as you know' before telling people things they do not know"},"physical":{"age":"early sixties","build":"tall with a slight stoop","feature":"a slight accent","clothes":"a good coat inherited from a larger relative"},"goal":{"short":"Find a patron among those who lead Craft Guilds, and make themselves useful to them.","long":"Understand how this place really works, every part of it.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"enter","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"power","