king for more money"},"plotHooks":["Someone left an item in their care and hasn't returned. The item is valuable. The absence is now suspicious."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Smells of dried herbs and vinegar. Asks after your health as if they mean it.","disposition":"welcoming","behaviour":"Listens to every symptom, names a remedy and a price, and remembers what you bought."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Apothecary (established)","family":"Apothecary district","title":"the apothecary","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_sawmill_commercial","name":"Myung Ito","gender":"male","role":"the sawyer","title":"the sawyer","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"temperate","flaw":"ruthless","modifier":"fatalistic","tell":"traces patterns on flat surfaces absentmindedly","speech":"Repeats key words for emphasis: 'The contract. The contract is clear'"},"physical":{"age":"late forties","build":"tall with a slight stoop","feature":"a voice that carries further than intended","clothes":"dress entirely without signal (deliberately so)"},"goal":{"short":"Prove to Eun Xiao that they are worth a bigger cut.","long":"Be counted one day among those who lead Craft Guilds.","intent":{"short":{"family":"ALLEGIANCE","kind":"serve_greed","key":"serve_patron","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Street gang"}},"long":{"family":"RANK","kind":"enter","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been cutting timber from woods that belong to someone else and floating it down at night","stakes":"The owner of those woods has started counting stumps and asking where the logs went"},"plotHooks":["A neighbour has accused them of moving a fence, and the neighbour has witnesses who were not there."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Busy and impatient. The saws run all day and e