n unnervingly fixed smile during conflict","speech":"Speaks softly, forcing others to lean in"},"physical":{"age":"late twenties","build":"willowy","feature":"a slight accent","clothes":"a good coat inherited from a larger relative"},"goal":{"short":"Keep the bakers working through the season even if the supply of grain should fail.","long":"Settle, once and for all, what they and Natsuki Wei owe each other.","intent":{"short":{"family":"SUPPLY","kind":"dependency","key":"secure_supply","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Bakers (5-15)"}},"long":{"family":"TIES","kind":"mentor_student","key":"protect_ally","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_alchemist_shop"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Mixes sawdust and chalk into the cheapest loaves when flour is dear","stakes":"The families who buy the cheapest bread are the poorest, and the anger would be quick"},"plotHooks":["Something they were told had been burned has turned up for sale."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Up since the middle of the night and quick about everything. The queue moves fast.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Sells what is baked; special orders by the day before, paid on collection."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Bakers (5-15)","family":"Bakers (5-15)","title":"the master baker","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_smelter","name":"Cheol Tang","gender":"male","role":"the smelt master","title":"the smelt master","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"loyal","flaw":"petty","modifier":"perfectionist","tell":"unconsciously mimics the posture of whoever they're speaking to","speech":"Peppers speech with trade or craft jargon even in unrelated contexts"},"physical":{"age":"early fifties","build":"heavyset and solid","feature":"a scar cutting through one eyebrow","clothes":"clothes practical for their work with one personal flourish"},"goal":{"short":"Do one thing for Craft Guilds this season that the people who lead it cannot ignore.","long":"Make the work at the smelter safe from the next shortage, with more than one source for every need.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"enter","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}},"long":{"family":"SUPPLY","kind":"impaired","key":"secure_supply","target":{"kind":"chain","id":"smelting"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been mixing cheap metal into the bars and selling them as pure","stakes":"The smiths who forged with those bars would know whose metal failed them"},"plotHooks":["A family they look after has stopped answering the door, and the shutters have stayed closed for a week."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Soot-dark skin and singed eyebrows. Talks loudly, as people do who work near a roaring furnace.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Sells by weight and quality; wants payment in coin, not promises."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Smelter","family":"Smelter","title":"the smelt master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_chandler","name":"Rui Xiao","gender":"male","role":"the chandler","title":"the chandler","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"generous","flaw":null,"modifier":"nostalgic","tell":"keeps their hands clasped behind their back when displeased","speech":"Uses softening phrases that make every statement sound like a question"},"physical":{"age":"early forties","build":"stocky and broad-shouldered","feature":"close-cropped hair","clothes":"travel-worn but well-maintained gear"},"goal":{"short":"Keep Yan He from getting the thing they want most this season.","long":"Turn the fight over blame for a costly failure last season into the moment Merchant Guilds began to lose.","intent":{"short":{"family":"TIES","kind":"rival_enemy","key":"settle_rivalry","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_dyer"}},"long":{"family":"POWER","kind":"conflict","key":"settle_rivalry","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Merchant Guilds"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Lit the fire that burned out a rival's shop three years ago, and told everyone it was an accident with a lamp","stakes":"The rival's family never believed it, and a witness has turned up"},"plotHooks":["They overheard two people they know settle a bribe, and do not know whom to tell."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Busy and practical. The shelves are packed tight and every item has a price.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Sells by the pound and the dozen; gives credit only to regulars."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Chandler","family":"Chandler","title":"the chandler","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_ropemaker","name":"Pengfei Tang","gender":"male","role":"the ropemaker","title":"the ropemaker","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"courteous","flaw":"corrupt","modifier":"obsessive","tell":"quotes scripture or proverbs in casual conversation","speech":"Wields professional titles with surgical precision. Rank omitted is rank denied"},"physical":{"age":"late fifties","build":"average height, unremarkable frame","feature":"ink-stained fingers","clothes":"dress entirely without signal (deliberately so)"},"goal":{"short":"Have the old rights of the ropemaker's ropewalk read out and recognised before anyone challenges them.","long":"Rise in Craft Guilds far enough that their word carries weight outside it.","intent":{"short":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"charter","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Ropemaker"}},"long":{"family":"RANK","kind":"enter","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been twisting short fibre into the heart of the rope and selling it as full strength","stakes":"When a rope breaks under a load, people are hurt, and every coil carries the maker's name"},"plotHooks":["Their savings were hidden in a place only one other person knew, and the savings are gone."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Friendly and chatty, with rough hands and a sailor's turn of phrase.","disposition":"welcoming","behaviour":"Talks about who is buying rope and why; hears a great deal from the carters and the builders."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Ropemaker","family":"Ropemaker","title":"the ropemaker","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_cartographer_s_workshop","name":"Guo Wang","gender":"male","role":"the cartographer","title":"the cartographer","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"courteous","flaw":"lazy","modifier":"melancholic","tell":"drums fingers on surfaces when thinking","speech":"Makes every point as a question they do not expect answered"},"physical":{"age":"early fifties","build":"stocky and broad-shouldered","feature":"a voice that carries further than intended","clothes":"work clothes patched by someone who loved them"},"goal":{"short":"Be in the room the next time Craft Guilds must decide something that matters.","long":"See the cartographer's workshop out of debt for good, with money set aside for bad years.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"enter","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}},"long":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"solvency","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Cartographer's workshop"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Draws two maps of the same country, the true one for those who pay well and a wrong one for everyone else","stakes":"Travellers who followed the wrong map have died in the hills, and their companions remember who sold it"},"plotHooks":["A neighbour's quarrel with them has gone before the people who settle disputes, and the hearing is next week."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Eager to hear about any road you have travelled, and quick to write down what you say.","disposition":"welcoming","behaviour":"Trades news of the road for news of the road; will correct a map on your word and thank you for it."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Cartographer's workshop","family":"Cartographer's workshop","title":"the cartographer","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_cobbler_s_guild","name":"Yang Liu","gender":"male","role":"the cobbler","title":"the cobbler","category":"other","personality":{"dominant":"level-headed","flaw":"cruel","modifier":"ambitious","tell":"checks exits in every new room before speaking","speech":"Speaks in analogies and metaphors, even when clarity would serve better"},"physical":{"age":"mid-fifties","build":"lean and wiry","feature":"an old injury that affects their gait","clothes":"work clothes patched by someone who loved them"},"goal":{"short":"Bring Craft Guilds a piece of news before anyone else does.","long":"Forgive Kai Matsumoto the debt in return for one great favour, when the time comes.","intent":{"short":{"family":"RANK","kind":"enter","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}},"long":{"family":"TIES","kind":"creditor","key":"collect_debt","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_barracks"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Carries messages in the heels of shoes sent out for repair, for people who pay well not to use a courier","stakes":"The people who read those messages, and the people they were about, would both want the cobbler silent"},"plotHooks":["Their oldest friend has started paying for drinks with new silver and will not say where it came from."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Practical and plain. Looks at your feet before your face.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Mends what is brought, makes what is ordered, and keeps every pair until it is paid for."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Cobbler's guild","family":"Cobbler's guild","title":"the cobbler","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Craft Guilds","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_parish_churches_2_5","name":"Tae Liu","gender":"male","role":"the dean","title":"the dean","category":"religious","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":null,"modifier":"idealistic","tell":"checks exits in every new room before speaking","speech":"Drops to a near-whisper when saying something important"},"physical":{"age":"late fifties","build":"tall with a slight stoop","feature":"a cough they suppress with visible effort","clothes":"vestments a size too grand for the shrine they serve"},"goal":{"short":"Do Mei Kato a favour big enough to count against what is owed.","long":"Be remembered as the one who kept the houses of worship out of debt.","intent":{"short":{"family":"TIES","kind":"debtor","key":"repay_debt","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_stable_district"}},"long":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"solvency","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Parish churches (2-5)"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been protecting a sibling's crime for years (a serious one)","stakes":"Discovery makes them an accessory; the sibling has reason to pre-empt exposure"},"plotHooks":["The holy relic in their keeping is not what everyone believes it is. Only they know this."],"influence":"moderate","power":6,"presentation":{"impression":"Interested in you as a person, or at least in what you might need. The attention feels real.","disposition":"welcoming","behaviour":"Offers information freely, and asks questions that sound like interest, not prying."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Parish churches (2-5)","family":"Access to parish church","title":"the dean","veiled":false},"memberships":