hey break.","settlementCondition":"stable","structuralRank":"head"},{"id":"npc_barracks","name":"Kai Matsumoto","gender":"male","role":"the garrison commander","title":"the garrison commander","category":"military","personality":{"dominant":"candid","flaw":"lazy","modifier":"calculating","tell":"hums under their breath when concentrating","speech":"Ends disagreements by restating the other position, slightly wrong"},"physical":{"age":"mid-forties","build":"compact and powerful","feature":"heavy-lidded eyes that suggest either wisdom or exhaustion","clothes":"soldier's practical dress with officer's insignia"},"goal":{"short":"Get enough on Eun Xiao to hold them, and make it stick.","long":"Hand The Guard on to an heir of their own choosing, and not to Ji Kimura.","intent":{"short":{"family":"ALLEGIANCE","kind":"warrant","key":"pursue_warrant","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_veiled_834d1a71b903e3a7"}},"long":{"family":"RANK","kind":"defend","key":"consolidate_power","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_town_watch"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Secretly receives what they believe are genuine divine visions, which terrifies them","stakes":"Acting on the visions would be seen as madness; ignoring them may be worse"},"plotHooks":["A deserter they let go quietly has been caught elsewhere and is telling everyone who let them walk."],"influence":"high","power":10,"presentation":{"impression":"Direct. They assess you in the first three seconds and their expression tells you they've reached a provisional conclusion.","disposition":"cautious","behaviour":"Keeps out of trouble by keeping away from you, and sends you to someone else when they can."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Barracks","family":"Barracks","title":"the garrison commander","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Military/Guard","rank":1,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"pillar","structuralPosition":"Commands those under arms in quiet times; the work is keeping trouble from starting.","activeConstraint":"It 