ople with false names and false pasts to employers who do not ask","stakes":"When one of them is caught, the hall's books will show who sent them"},"plotHooks":["A shipment they weren't expecting arrived and is now in their warehouse. They don't know who sent it or what to do."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Cheerful and quick. Makes everyone feel there is work for them.","disposition":"welcoming","behaviour":"Takes your name and promises something soon."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Hireling hall","family":"Hireling hall","title":"the hiring master","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Guild Council","rank":null,"share":1,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_brothel","name":"Saburo Chen","gender":"male","role":"the keeper of the house","title":"the keeper of the house","category":"criminal","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"overbearing","modifier":"traditionalist","tell":"checks exits in every new room before speaking","speech":"Answers questions with inventories: 'Three reasons. First.'"},"physical":{"age":"seventies","build":"slight: smaller than expected for the role","feature":"laugh lines that run deep","clothes":"fine clothes worn ironically over rougher garments"},"goal":{"short":"Get to whatever both Merchant Guilds and Craft Guilds want this season first.","long":"Become someone Guild Council cannot do without.","intent":{"short":{"family":"POWER","kind":"competitive","key":"expand_influence","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Craft Guilds"}},"long":{"family":"RANK","kind":"enter","key":"secure_office","target":{"kind":"power","id":"Guild Council"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Pays someone in authority to leave the house alone and to send word before any raid","stakes":"If the arrangement became known, both of them would fall, and the official would deny knowing the madam"},"plotHooks":["A rival crew has offered peace, and the offer arrived on the same day one of their people went missing."],"influence":"low","power":3,"presentation":{"impression":"Gracious and watchful. Knows every face in the house and notices a new one at once.","disposition":"cautious","behaviour":"Discreet; trouble is shown the door quietly and quickly."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Brothel","family":"Brothel (red light district)","title":"the madam","veiled":false},"memberships":[{"power":"Guild Council","rank":null,"share":0.6,"veiled":false},{"power":"Merchant Guilds","rank":null,"share":0.4,"veiled":false}],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"member"},{"id":"npc_caravaneer_s_post","name":"Tama Wei","gender":"female","role":"the post's master","title":"the post's master","category":"economy","personality":{"dominant":null,"flaw":"stubborn","modifier":"hedonistic","tell":"uses elaborate, florid greetings regardless of context","speech":"Speaks softly, forcing others to lean in"},"physical":{"age":"late sixties","build":"lean and wiry","feature":"a network of small scars on their knuckles","clothes":"sober broadcloth with buttons worth more than the coat"},"goal":{"short":"Have the last word in the next argument that matters.","long":"Hand on the caravaneer's post with full stores, honest accounts and nothing owed.","intent":{"short":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"sway","key":"indulge_trait","target":null},"long":{"family":"INSTITUTION","kind":"solvency","key":"control_institution","target":{"kind":"house","id":"Caravaneer's post"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Sends caravans out on the days that suit the merchant who pays most, and holds the others back","stakes":"The merchants held back have lost sales, and they talk to one another at every stop"},"plotHooks":["A family they put out of business has opened again under a new name, two doors down."],"influence":"low","power":1,"presentation":{"impression":"Brisk, with a board of departures behind them and chalk on the fingers.","disposition":"transactional","behaviour":"Names the next departure, the fee to join it and t