 comments when others do not","speech":"Answers questions with inventories: 'Three reasons. First.'"},"physical":{"age":"early sixties","build":"slight: smaller than expected for the role","feature":"eyes that never stop moving","clothes":"work clothes patched by someone who loved them"},"goal":{"short":"Check everything twice before they put their name to it.","long":"Settle things with Yuki Liang for good, one way or another.","intent":{"short":{"family":"PERSONALITY","kind":"caution","key":"indulge_trait","target":null},"long":{"family":"TIES","kind":"rival_enemy","key":"settle_rivalry","target":{"kind":"npc","id":"npc_carpenters_5_15"}}}},"secret":{"what":"Has been stealing from the houses the troupe performs in, while the others play","stakes":"The troupe does not know, and when it comes out they will be blamed with the leader"},"plotHooks":["A regular customer has stopped coming. The reason they've been given doesn't make sense."],"influence":"low","power":2,"presentation":{"impression":"Smiling and watchful. Notices who in the room has money.","disposition":"cautious","behaviour":"Friendly but gives away little about the troupe."},"institution":{"kind":"house","key":"Traveling performers","family":"Village musician","title":"the troupe leader","veiled":false},"memberships":[],"importance":"minor","structuralRank":"unaffiliated"}],"relationships":[{"id":"tie_npc_merchant_warehouses","from":"npc_merchant_warehouses","to":"npc_traveling_performers","type":"mentor_student","typeName":"Mentor and Successor","description":"Jun Cao still keeps Genji Wei's hours and Genji Wei's ledger format. Everyone who deals with Jun Cao recognises the teacher.","tension":"Genji Wei has asked Jun Cao for a loan. It is the first time a debt between teacher and student has run that way.","strength":"formal","npc1Name":"Genji Wei","npc2Name":"Jun Cao","npc1Role":"Alderman","npc2Role":"the troupe leader","archetypeKey":"mentor_legacy","proseVariant":6,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_barracks","from":"npc_barracks","to":"npc_cobbler_s_guild","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Kai Matsumoto borrowed Yang Liu's good name to win a post. Yang Liu has never asked for it back.","tension":"Yang Liu has begun to count the debt Kai Matsumoto owes among Yang Liu's assets, and has had it written down before witnesses.","strength":"substantial","npc1Name":"Kai Matsumoto","npc2Name":"Yang Liu","npc1Role":"the garrison commander","npc2Role":"the cobbler","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":7,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_taverns_5_20","from":"npc_taverns_5_20","to":"npc_cobbler_s_guild","type":"ally","typeName":"Pragmatic Alliance","description":"Ruixiang Inoue and Yang Liu signed a pact after their last quarrel cost them both. They keep to its terms exactly.","tension":"Ruixiang Inoue and Yang Liu both want the same office, and the alliance cannot survive one of them winning it.","strength":"strong","npc1Name":"Ruixiang Inoue","npc2Name":"Yang Liu","npc1Role":"the tavern keeper","npc2Role":"the cobbler","archetypeKey":"wary_alliance","proseVariant":6,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_power_landed_gentry","from":"npc_power_landed_gentry","to":"npc_merchant_warehouses","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Tae Yamada owes Genji Wei a great deal, and neither has ever said so aloud.","tension":"Genji Wei is about to call it in.","strength":"minor","npc1Name":"Tae Yamada","npc2Name":"Genji Wei","npc1Role":"the lord","npc2Role":"Alderman","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":0,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_blacksmiths_3_10","from":"npc_blacksmiths_3_10","to":"npc_cartographer_s_workshop","type":"rival","typeName":"Professional Rivalry","description":"Every gain Dan Tanaka makes, Guo Wang answers within the season, and people here have learned to expect it.","tension":"Dan Tanaka has recently broken an unwritten rule of the contest. Guo Wang is deciding what that permits.","strength":"professional","npc1Name":"Dan Tanaka","npc2Name":"Guo Wang","npc1Role":"the master smith","npc2Role":"the cartographer","archetypeKey":"peer_rivalry","proseVariant":2,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_mine","from":"npc_mine","to":"npc_parish_churches_2_5","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Years ago Tae Liu did Manchu Gao a favour too large to repay, and Manchu Gao has been paying it back in small ways ever since.","tension":"Manchu Gao has begun to act like someone who considers the debt paid. Tae Liu does not.","strength":"minor","npc1Name":"Manchu Gao","npc2Name":"Tae Liu","npc1Role":"the mine captain","npc2Role":"the dean","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":1,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_town_granary","from":"npc_town_granary","to":"npc_town_watch","type":"political","typeName":"Mutual Leverage","description":"Xin Hayashi and Ji Kimura sit on opposite sides of most questions and vote together on the few that touch their shared interests.","tension":"Ji Kimura has written down what Xin Hayashi owes and left a copy with a notary.","strength":"stable","npc1Name":"Xin Hayashi","npc2Name":"Ji Kimura","npc1Role":"the granary reeve","npc2Role":"the watch captain","archetypeKey":"mutual_leverage","proseVariant":7,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_courthouse","from":"npc_courthouse","to":"npc_merchant_warehouses","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Financial Dependence","description":"Ai Inoue owes Genji Wei more than the settlement collects in two years of taxes. Genji Wei is paid first, every quarter.","tension":"Genji Wei is calling in a third of the debt at once. Ai Inoue has until the next quarter day to find it.","strength":"crushing","npc1Name":"Ai Inoue","npc2Name":"Genji Wei","npc1Role":"the magistrate","npc2Role":"Alderman","archetypeKey":"gov_econ_dependence","proseVariant":5,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_town_watch","from":"npc_town_watch","to":"npc_cartographer_s_workshop","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Ji Kimura owes Guo Wang for an old kindness. Neither mentions it, and both know exactly how much is still owed.","tension":"Someone else has learned what favour Ji Kimura owes Guo Wang, and now has a hold on Ji Kimura too.","strength":"minor","npc1Name":"Ji Kimura","npc2Name":"Guo Wang","npc1Role":"the watch captain","npc2Role":"the cartographer","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":2,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_free_company_hall","from":"npc_free_company_hall","to":"npc_town_granary","type":"respect","typeName":"Genuine Respect","description":"Dawon Watanabe sends difficult cases to Xin Hayashi, and Xin Hayashi sends them back solved. Neither has ever charged the other a fee.","tension":"Dawon Watanabe has learned something about Xin Hayashi's family that Xin Hayashi does not know.","strength":"genuine","npc1Name":"Dawon Watanabe","npc2Name":"Xin Hayashi","npc1Role":"the company captain","npc2Role":"the granary reeve","archetypeKey":"genuine_respect","proseVariant":3,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_beast_trainers","from":"npc_beast_trainers","to":"npc_town_crier","type":"mentor_student","typeName":"Mentor and Successor","description":"Fengyi Yamamoto once told a full room that Kang Huang was the best pupil they had taught. Fengyi Yamamoto has not said it since.","tension":"Kang Huang has begun teaching Fengyi Yamamoto's methods as Kang Huang's own.","strength":"devoted","npc1Name":"Fengyi Yamamoto","npc2Name":"Kang Huang","npc1Role":"the beast master","npc2Role":"the crier","archetypeKey":"mentor_legacy","proseVariant":7,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_mills_2_5","from":"npc_mills_2_5","to":"npc_carriers_guild","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Ukon Shimizu paid Kazuko Xie's bail eleven years ago and has never mentioned it. Kazuko Xie mentions it to no one.","tension":"Ukon Shimizu has asked Kazuko Xie for a vote against Kazuko Xie's own interests. It is the first payment Ukon Shimizu has asked for.","strength":"substantial","npc1Name":"Kazuko Xie","npc2Name":"Ukon Shimizu","npc1Role":"the miller","npc2Role":"the carriers' master","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":3,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_tanners","from":"npc_tanners","to":"npc_bakers_5_15","type":"respect","typeName":"Genuine Respect","description":"Nianzu Yamamoto and Emiko Yamamoto have stood on opposite sides of three disputes and praised each other after every one.","tension":"Emiko Yamamoto has been offered Nianzu Yamamoto's post by people who want Nianzu Yamamoto gone.","strength":"genuine","npc1Name":"Nianzu Yamamoto","npc2Name":"Emiko Yamamoto","npc1Role":"the tanner","npc2Role":"the master baker","archetypeKey":"genuine_respect","proseVariant":4,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_alchemist_shop","from":"npc_alchemist_shop","to":"npc_parish_churches_2_5","type":"enemy","typeName":"Unresolved History","description":"Something happened between Natsuki Wei and Tae Liu years ago that neither has forgotten. They function professionally. They do not forgive.","tension":"What first broke Natsuki Wei and Tae Liu apart is happening again, and both of them know it.","strength":"mild","npc1Name":"Natsuki Wei","npc2Name":"Tae Liu","npc1Role":"the alchemist","npc2Role":"the dean","archetypeKey":"bitter_history","proseVariant":0,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_inn_multiple","from":"npc_inn_multiple","to":"npc_town_watch","type":"mentor_student","typeName":"Mentor and Successor","description":"Jong Inoue made Ji Kimura's career, and Ji Kimura rarely says so.","tension":"Ji Kimura now operates in ways Jong Inoue would not approve of. Neither discusses the divergence directly.","strength":"formal","npc1Name":"Jong Inoue","npc2Name":"Ji Kimura","npc1Role":"the innkeeper","npc2Role":"the watch captain","archetypeKey":"mentor_legacy","proseVariant":0,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_stable_district","from":"npc_stable_district","to":"npc_barracks","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Mei Kato owes Kai Matsumoto a large sum in coin, borrowed in a bad year and repaid in small amounts ever since.","tension":"Mei Kato has offered to clear what is left of the debt in one payment. Kai Matsumoto would rather be repaid in favours.","strength":"substantial","npc1Name":"Mei Kato","npc2Name":"Kai Matsumoto","npc1Role":"the stable master","npc2Role":"the garrison commander","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":4,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_town_crier","from":"npc_town_crier","to":"npc_tailor_s_guild","type":"political","typeName":"Mutual Leverage","description":"Kang Huang and Midori Xu each hold information or resources the other needs. They cooperate efficiently and neither trusts the other at all.","tension":"The balance between Kang Huang and Midori Xu has recently shifted. Midori Xu has noticed; Kang Huang has not, yet.","strength":"stable","npc1Name":"Kang Huang","npc2Name":"Midori Xu","npc1Role":"the crier","npc2Role":"the tailor","archetypeKey":"mutual_leverage","proseVariant":0,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_small_prison_stocks","from":"npc_small_prison_stocks","to":"npc_mills_2_5","type":"political","typeName":"Mutual Leverage","description":"Jun Zhou knows enough to ruin Kazuko Xie, and Kazuko Xie holds enough to finish Jun Zhou, so the two of them work together very carefully.","tension":"A document Jun Zhou and Kazuko Xie each believed only they possessed has turned up in someone else's hands.","strength":"unbreakable","npc1Name":"Jun Zhou","npc2Name":"Kazuko Xie","npc1Role":"the gaoler","npc2Role":"the miller","archetypeKey":"mutual_leverage","proseVariant":1,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_hireling_hall","from":"npc_hireling_hall","to":"npc_carpenters_5_15","type":"political","typeName":"Mutual Leverage","description":"Zong Sato and Yuki Liang deal with each other slowly and politely, each knowing one slip could ruin them both.","tension":"Yuki Liang has recently secured something that makes Zong Sato's hold obsolete. The politeness continues, for now.","strength":"stable","npc1Name":"Zong Sato","npc2Name":"Yuki Liang","npc1Role":"the hiring master","npc2Role":"the master carpenter","archetypeKey":"mutual_leverage","proseVariant":2,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_brothel","from":"npc_brothel","to":"npc_town_watch","type":"enemy","typeName":"Active Suppression","description":"Ji Kimura has driven Saburo Chen's people out of three houses this year. Saburo Chen has opened four.","tension":"Ji Kimura has a witness willing to name Saburo Chen before a magistrate. Saburo Chen knows where the witness lives.","strength":"mortal","npc1Name":"Saburo Chen","npc2Name":"Ji Kimura","npc1Role":"the keeper of the house","npc2Role":"the watch captain","archetypeKey":"mil_crim_suppression","proseVariant":3,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_caravaneer_s_post","from":"npc_caravaneer_s_post","to":"npc_merchant_warehouses","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Genji Wei kept Tama Wei's name out of a scandal that ruined two others. Tama Wei has voted with Genji Wei ever since.","tension":"Genji Wei has mentioned the debt aloud, at a dinner, in front of Tama Wei's partners.","strength":"crushing","npc1Name":"Tama Wei","npc2Name":"Genji Wei","npc1Role":"the post's master","npc2Role":"Alderman","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":5,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_craft_guilds_5_15","from":"npc_craft_guilds_5_15","to":"npc_carpenters_5_15","type":"enemy","typeName":"Unresolved History","description":"Umeko Li and Yuki Liang were close once, and whatever broke between them is the one subject neither will discuss.","tension":"Umeko Li and Yuki Liang each think the other owes the apology.","strength":"serious","npc1Name":"Umeko Li","npc2Name":"Yuki Liang","npc1Role":"the senior craft-guild master","npc2Role":"the master carpenter","archetypeKey":"bitter_history","proseVariant":1,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_fish_market","from":"npc_fish_market","to":"npc_merchant_warehouses","type":"mentor_student","typeName":"Mentor and Successor","description":"Genji Wei owes their place to Tomoko Tang and has kept others from climbing the same way. The two of them remember it differently.","tension":"Tomoko Tang has one favour left to call in, and is saving it. Genji Wei knows, and is watching for it.","strength":"devoted","npc1Name":"Tomoko Tang","npc2Name":"Genji Wei","npc1Role":"the master fishmonger","npc2Role":"Alderman","archetypeKey":"mentor_legacy","proseVariant":1,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_weavers_textile_workers","from":"npc_weavers_textile_workers","to":"npc_parish_churches_2_5","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Tae Liu nursed Qi Shimizu through a winter fever when no one else would come. Qi Shimizu still owes the debt and still knows it.","tension":"Qi Shimizu has refused Tae Liu a small favour for the first time in years.","strength":"crushing","npc1Name":"Qi Shimizu","npc2Name":"Tae Liu","npc1Role":"the master weaver","npc2Role":"the dean","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":6,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_hunter_s_lodge","from":"npc_hunter_s_lodge","to":"npc_merchant_warehouses","type":"mentor_student","typeName":"Mentor and Successor","description":"Shufen Yang taught Genji Wei everything, including how to get the better of Shufen Yang.","tension":"A third party has asked Shufen Yang, quietly, whether Genji Wei can be trusted. The answer took too long.","strength":"lifelong","npc1Name":"Shufen Yang","npc2Name":"Genji Wei","npc1Role":"the master of the hunt","npc2Role":"Alderman","archetypeKey":"mentor_legacy","proseVariant":2,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_bowyers_fletchers_guild","from":"npc_bowyers_fletchers_guild","to":"npc_apothecary_established","type":"rival","typeName":"Professional Rivalry","description":"Jin Gao and Mei Kimura sit at the same tables and want the same things from them. Each counts the other's wins more carefully than their own.","tension":"Jin Gao has hired away Mei Kimura's best assistant. Mei Kimura has said nothing about it, to anyone.","strength":"bitter","npc1Name":"Jin Gao","npc2Name":"Mei Kimura","npc1Role":"the bowyer","npc2Role":"the apothecary","archetypeKey":"peer_rivalry","proseVariant":3,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_carriers_guild","from":"npc_carriers_guild","to":"npc_beast_trainers","type":"rival","typeName":"Professional Rivalry","description":"Ukon Shimizu and Fengyi Yamamoto trained together and have competed ever since. The settlement keeps score, and so do they.","tension":"A post opens at midsummer, and only Ukon Shimizu or Fengyi Yamamoto can fill it.","strength":"bitter","npc1Name":"Ukon Shimizu","npc2Name":"Fengyi Yamamoto","npc1Role":"the carriers' master","npc2Role":"the beast master","archetypeKey":"peer_rivalry","proseVariant":4,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_carpenters_5_15","from":"npc_carpenters_5_15","to":"npc_barracks","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Kai Matsumoto nursed Yuki Liang through a winter fever when no one else would come. Yuki Liang still owes the debt and still knows it.","tension":"Yuki Liang has refused Kai Matsumoto a small favour for the first time in years.","strength":"substantial","npc1Name":"Yuki Liang","npc2Name":"Kai Matsumoto","npc1Role":"the master carpenter","npc2Role":"the garrison commander","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":6,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_cooper","from":"npc_cooper","to":"npc_caravaneer_s_post","type":"respect","typeName":"Genuine Respect","description":"Tama Wei once told the council that Tae Huang was right and Tama Wei was wrong. Tae Huang has not forgotten it.","tension":"Tae Huang has made a mistake that Tama Wei is bound to report. Tama Wei has not reported it.","strength":"grudging","npc1Name":"Tae Huang","npc2Name":"Tama Wei","npc1Role":"the cooper","npc2Role":"the post's master","archetypeKey":"genuine_respect","proseVariant":5,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_apothecary_established","from":"npc_apothecary_established","to":"npc_cooper","type":"political","typeName":"Mutual Leverage","description":"Mei Kimura and Tae Huang trade favours on a strict count. Neither has ever been more than one favour ahead.","tension":"Mei Kimura has asked Tae Huang for a second favour before repaying the first, which would put Mei Kimura two favours ahead.","strength":"convenience","npc1Name":"Mei Kimura","npc2Name":"Tae Huang","npc1Role":"the apothecary","npc2Role":"the cooper","archetypeKey":"mutual_leverage","proseVariant":3,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_sawmill_commercial","from":"npc_sawmill_commercial","to":"npc_veiled_834d1a71b903e3a7","type":"patron_client","typeName":"Silent Partnership","description":"Eun Xiao's silver bought the friends who raised Myung Ito to where Myung Ito stands today. Myung Ito repays it in favours, quietly and on time.","tension":"Myung Ito hopes to rise again this season. Eun Xiao expects the favours to grow with Myung Ito's standing.","strength":"nominal","npc1Name":"Myung Ito","npc2Name":"Eun Xiao","npc1Role":"the sawyer","npc2Role":"the gang boss","archetypeKey":"handler_partnership","proseVariant":3,"flagDriven":false,"covert":true,"handler":true},{"id":"tie_npc_dyer","from":"npc_dyer","to":"npc_blacksmiths_3_10","type":"rival","typeName":"Professional Rivalry","description":"Yan He wants Dan Tanaka's position, and Dan Tanaka wants Yan He's reputation. They are civil in public and unforgiving in private.","tension":"Dan Tanaka has been telling clients that Yan He's work is slipping. Two of the clients have repeated it to Yan He.","strength":"personal","npc1Name":"Yan He","npc2Name":"Dan Tanaka","npc1Role":"the dyer","npc2Role":"the master smith","archetypeKey":"peer_rivalry","proseVariant":5,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_tailor_s_guild","from":"npc_tailor_s_guild","to":"npc_inn_multiple","type":"political","typeName":"Mutual Leverage","description":"Midori Xu controls a vote Jong Inoue needs, and Jong Inoue controls a supply Midori Xu needs. Their meetings are short and their bargains hold.","tension":"Jong Inoue has found a new source for what Midori Xu supplies. Midori Xu has not been told.","strength":"convenience","npc1Name":"Midori Xu","npc2Name":"Jong Inoue","npc1Role":"the tailor","npc2Role":"the innkeeper","archetypeKey":"mutual_leverage","proseVariant":4,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_butchers_3_8","from":"npc_butchers_3_8","to":"npc_smelter","type":"respect","typeName":"Genuine Respect","description":"Yan Zhang and Cheol Tang consult each other before any decision that matters. The advice is honest and is always taken seriously.","tension":"The council has asked Yan Zhang and Cheol Tang to audit each other's accounts. Both agreed, and neither is comfortable.","strength":"grudging","npc1Name":"Yan Zhang","npc2Name":"Cheol Tang","npc1Role":"the master butcher","npc2Role":"the smelt master","archetypeKey":"genuine_respect","proseVariant":6,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_bakers_5_15","from":"npc_bakers_5_15","to":"npc_alchemist_shop","type":"mentor_student","typeName":"Mentor and Successor","description":"Emiko Yamamoto took Natsuki Wei under their wing early and taught them the customs, the clients, and the names worth knowing.","tension":"Natsuki Wei has taken on a client Emiko Yamamoto turned away on principle.","strength":"lifelong","npc1Name":"Emiko Yamamoto","npc2Name":"Natsuki Wei","npc1Role":"the master baker","npc2Role":"the alchemist","archetypeKey":"mentor_legacy","proseVariant":3,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_smelter","from":"npc_smelter","to":"npc_apothecary_established","type":"rival","typeName":"Professional Rivalry","description":"Every friend Cheol Tang wins is one Mei Kimura lost, and the reverse. The two keep a polite distance and an exact tally.","tension":"Cheol Tang and Mei Kimura will both present proposals at the next council session. Only one will be accepted.","strength":"personal","npc1Name":"Cheol Tang","npc2Name":"Mei Kimura","npc1Role":"the smelt master","npc2Role":"the apothecary","archetypeKey":"peer_rivalry","proseVariant":6,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_chandler","from":"npc_chandler","to":"npc_dyer","type":"rival","typeName":"Professional Rivalry","description":"Rui Xiao and Yan He are rivals for the same patron's favour. Each has spent the year trying to be first through the patron's door.","tension":"Rui Xiao lost the last contract to Yan He by a single vote, and has learned who cast it.","strength":"bitter","npc1Name":"Rui Xiao","npc2Name":"Yan He","npc1Role":"the chandler","npc2Role":"the dyer","archetypeKey":"peer_rivalry","proseVariant":7,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_ropemaker","from":"npc_ropemaker","to":"npc_apothecary_established","type":"political","typeName":"Mutual Leverage","description":"Pengfei Tang and Mei Kimura each have something to trade and nothing to give away. They meet in private, bargain hard, and keep every bargain.","tension":"The vote Mei Kimura needs from Pengfei Tang comes up next week, and Pengfei Tang has named a new price.","strength":"stable","npc1Name":"Pengfei Tang","npc2Name":"Mei Kimura","npc1Role":"the ropemaker","npc2Role":"the apothecary","archetypeKey":"mutual_leverage","proseVariant":5,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_cartographer_s_workshop","from":"npc_cartographer_s_workshop","to":"npc_caravaneer_s_post","type":"enemy","typeName":"Unresolved History","description":"The quarrel between Guo Wang and Tama Wei is old enough that no one else remembers the cause. They remember. They have simply stopped explaining.","tension":"A newcomer keeps trying to reconcile Guo Wang and Tama Wei, and is about to learn why nobody else does.","strength":"mild","npc1Name":"Guo Wang","npc2Name":"Tama Wei","npc1Role":"the cartographer","npc2Role":"the post's master","archetypeKey":"bitter_history","proseVariant":2,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_cobbler_s_guild","from":"npc_cobbler_s_guild","to":"npc_ropemaker","type":"rival","typeName":"Professional Rivalry","description":"Yang Liu and Pengfei Tang want the same thing and compete hard for it, but neither has let it turn into hatred.","tension":"A decision coming next season will favour Yang Liu or Pengfei Tang heavily, and both of them know it.","strength":"professional","npc1Name":"Yang Liu","npc2Name":"Pengfei Tang","npc1Role":"the cobbler","npc2Role":"the ropemaker","archetypeKey":"peer_rivalry","proseVariant":0,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_parish_churches_2_5","from":"npc_parish_churches_2_5","to":"npc_stable_district","type":"debtor_creditor","typeName":"Outstanding Debt","description":"Tae Liu borrowed Mei Kato's good name to win a post. Mei Kato has never asked for it back.","tension":"Mei Kato has begun to count the debt Tae Liu owes among Mei Kato's assets, and has had it written down before witnesses.","strength":"substantial","npc1Name":"Tae Liu","npc2Name":"Mei Kato","npc1Role":"the dean","npc2Role":"the stable master","archetypeKey":"old_debt","proseVariant":7,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_veiled_834d1a71b903e3a7","from":"npc_veiled_834d1a71b903e3a7","to":"npc_alchemist_shop","type":"ally","typeName":"Pragmatic Alliance","description":"Eun Xiao and Natsuki Wei are allies with separate interests. They meet to coordinate and leave by different doors.","tension":"Natsuki Wei has asked Eun Xiao to back a candidate Eun Xiao distrusts. Refusing would cost the alliance its majority.","strength":"weak","npc1Name":"Eun Xiao","npc2Name":"Natsuki Wei","npc1Role":"the gang boss","npc2Role":"the alchemist","archetypeKey":"wary_alliance","proseVariant":7,"flagDriven":false},{"id":"tie_npc_traveling_performers","from":"npc_traveling_performers","to":"npc_carpenters_5_15","type":"political","typeName":"Mutual Leverage","description":"Yuki Liang needs Jun Cao's seal on certain papers; Jun Cao needs Yuki Liang's silence about certain others. Neither has asked for more than the other could pay.","tension":"Jun Cao's secret is about to come out by other means. Once it does, Yuki Liang holds nothing over Jun Cao.","strength":"convenience","npc1Name":"Jun Cao","npc2Name":"Yuki Liang","npc1Role":"the troupe leader","npc2Role":"the master carpenter","archetypeKey":"mutual_leverage","proseVariant":6,"flagDriven":false}],"conflicts":[{"parties":["Guild Council","Craft Guilds"],"issue":"Prices set on everyday goods","stakes":"Livelihoods","intensity":"high","desc":"Guild Council and Craft Guilds are in high conflict over prices set on everyday goods. The stakes are livelihoods.","plotHooks":["Someone is offering to resolve the conflict \"permanently\" for a price. Both powers have received the offer. Neither has refused yet."]},{"parties":["Guild Council","Military/Guard"],"issue":"Succession to a council seat","stakes":"Political influence","intensity":"moderate","desc":"Guild Council and The Guard are in moderate conflict over succession to a council seat. The stakes are political influence.","plotHooks":["The vote on the empty seat is in four days, and two of the voters have not been seen since the last meeting."]},{"parties":["Merchant Guilds","Craft Guilds"],"issue":"Blame for a costly failure last season","stakes":"Reputation","intensity":"moderate","desc":"Merchant Guilds and Craft Guilds are in moderate conflict over blame for a costly failure last season. The stakes are reputation.","plotHooks":["Each side has been told, in secret, that the other can be made to go away for good. The price is the same for both."]}],"powerStructure":{"factions":[{"faction":"Guild Council","modifier":"arcane-advised","power":36,"desc":"The guilds govern together; the richer the guild, the more say it has.","isGoverning":true,"category":"economy","rawPower":26,"powerLabel":"Strong"},{"faction":"Merchant Guilds","power":21,"desc":"Dominant commercial class; their capital and networks give them leverage even formal institutions must respect. Behind the governing council by too much to challenge openly, so they get their way through petitions and procedure instead. The craft guilds are present but outpaced; merchants set prices, craft masters object, and merchants win more often than not.","category":"economy","rawPower":19,"powerLabel":"Significant"},{"faction":"Military/Guard","power":20,"desc":"Town watch; it enforces ordinances, manages disorder, and reports to the council. Close enough to the two above that their support is worth buying; they play Merchant Guilds and Guild Council against each other when they can.","category":"military","rawPower":19,"powerLabel":"Minor"},{"faction":"Landed Gentry","power":12,"desc":"Landed families increasingly outpaced by merchant capital; they compete for council seats, marriage alliances, and royal appointments to maintain relevance. The merchants are closing the gap, and the noble families are using every law and every social tie they have to slow them down.","category":"noble","rawPower":11,"powerLabel":"Minor"},{"faction":"Craft Guilds","power":11,"desc":"The trades regulate their own production and apprenticeships; a reliable secondary presence in civic life. The merchants consistently outvote them on pricing and labour standards, so craft masters now win what they can by adding their own conditions to each deal.","category":"economy","rawPower":11,"powerLabel":"Minor"}],"governingName":"Guild Council","government":"Guild Council","stability":"Ordered (strong military presence)","recentConflict":"The merchant class is outbuying noble landholdings. Three estates have changed hands in the last decade. The families that lost them have not forgotten.","publicLegitimacy":{"score":76,"label":"Endorsed","color":"#1a5a28","bg":"#f0faf4","breakdown":{"prosperity":20,"safety":0,"defense":6,"food":0},"govMultiplier":1.3,"crimMultiplier":0.75,"isEndorsed":true,"isApproved":true,"isTolerated":false,"isContested":false,"isLegitimacyCrisis":false,"governanceFractured":false},"factionRelationships":[{"pair":["Guild Council","Military/Guard"],"type":"symbiotic","direction":"stable","ratio":0.55,"narrative":"Guild Council gives the orders and The Guard carries them out; each needs the other to stay strong. Even so, the two are now at odds over succession to a council seat.","dmNote":null},{"pair":["Guild Council","Merchant Guilds"],"type":"subordinate","direction":"escalating","ratio":0.58,"narrative":"Merchant Guilds work under the rules Guild Council sets, and pay for a hearing in the hall when it wants something."},{"pair":["Merchant Guilds","Craft Guilds"],"type":"competitive","direction":"escalating","ratio":1.8,"narrative":"Merchant Guilds buy the materials, set the prices and sell the goods; Craft Guilds only make them, and their masters are becoming hired hands in all but name."},{"pair":["Landed Gentry","Guild Council"],"type":"subordinate","direction":"declining","ratio":0.32,"narrative":"Landed Gentry still has its titles, but merchant money and the hall's offices have taken most of its power."}],"criminalCaptureState":"none","powerProjectionVersion":1,"economyInputFingerprint":"power-economy-v1:f2e281f9","conflicts":[{"parties":["Guild Council","Craft Guilds"],"issue":"Prices set on everyday goods","stakes":"Livelihoods","intensity":"high","desc":"Guild Council and Craft Guilds are in high conflict over prices set on everyday goods. The stakes are livelihoods.","plotHooks":["Someone is offering to resolve the conflict \"permanently\" for a price. Both powers have received the offer. Neither has refused yet."]},{"parties":["Guild Council","Military/Guard"],"issue":"Succession to a council seat","stakes":"Political influence","intensity":"moderate","desc":"Guild Council and The Guard are in moderate conflict over succession to a council seat. The stakes are political influence.","plotHooks":["The vote on the empty seat is in four days, and two of the voters have not been seen since the last meeting."]},{"parties":["Merchant Guilds","Craft Guilds"],"issue":"Blame for a costly failure last season","stakes":"Reputation","intensity":"moderate","desc":"Merchant Guilds and Craft Guilds are in moderate conflict over blame for a costly failure last season. The stakes are reputation.","plotHooks":["Each side has been told, in secret, that the other can be made to go away for good. The price is the same for both."]}]},"simulationTrace":[{"causes":[{"source":"config.settType=town","reason":"Tier set directly by user choice."}],"downstreamEffects":[{"target":"population","effect":"range 300–2500"},{"target":"institutionPool","effect":"scaling tier"}],"targetType":"condition","targetId":"tier.town","step":"resolveConfig","result":"selected","ts":0},{"causes":[{"source":"config.terrainOverride=auto","reason":"Terrain not pinned: weighted-rolled from regional pool."}],"downstreamEffects":[{"target":"tradeRoutePool","effect":"terrain-constrained"},{"target":"resourcePool","effect":"terrain-biased"}],"targetType":"condition","targetId":"terrain.plains","step":"resolveConfig","result":"rolled","ts":1},{"causes":[{"source":"terrain.plains","reason":"Picked from coherence-safe pool: crossroads, crossroads, road, road, river."}],"downstreamEffects":[{"target":"economicViability","effect":"trade-access input"}],"targetType":"condition","targetId":"tradeRoute.road","step":"resolveConfig","result":"rolled","ts":2},{"causes":[{"source":"config.monsterThreat=random_threat","reason":"Picked from frontier-weighted threat distribution."}],"downstreamEffects":[{"target":"defenseProfile","effect":"threat-tier input"}],"targetType":"threat","targetId":"monsterThreat.frontier","step":"resolveConfig","result":"rolled","ts":3},{"causes":[{"source":"config.culture=random_culture","reason":"Culture not pinned: picked from canonical 11-culture catalog."}],"downstreamEffects":[{"target":"namePool","effect":"culture-scoped"},{"target":"institutionFlavor","effect":"culture-scoped"}],"targetType":"condition","targetId":"culture.east_asian",